1
00:00:04,706 --> 00:00:09,206
如果任何人尝试违抗我的命令
If anyone tries anything other than what I've ordered,

2
00:00:09,456 --> 00:00:10,415
曼特城就完了
Mantle is gone.

3
00:00:12,456 --> 00:00:13,831
你有一个小时的时间来给我答复
You have one hour to respond.

4
00:00:14,665 --> 00:00:16,998
我希望你对得起我赋予你的名号
I hope you live up to the title I gave you.

5
00:00:29,498 --> 00:00:31,331
他当然不会真这么做
Of course he's not gonna do it.

6
00:00:31,665 --> 00:00:34,623
所以他在用整座城的命运吓小孩?
So what, he's bluffing? With the whole city?

7
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:37,706
或许这才能让那些孩子认清道理
It may finally push the kids to see reason.

8
00:00:37,956 --> 00:00:38,790
谁在乎呢?
Who cares?

9
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:41,123
很好
Good,

10
00:00:42,373 --> 00:00:43,123
你们都在
you're here.

11
00:00:45,331 --> 00:00:47,248
我需要一组无人机待命
I need a squad of drones in standby

12
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:48,081
随时投掷炸弹
to drop the payload.

13
00:00:48,706 --> 00:00:49,540
长官
Sir

14
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:50,915
为了什么?
what for?

15
00:00:52,623 --> 00:00:54,498
我想我在广播里说得很明白了
I believe I was clear in the broadcast.

16
00:00:55,748 --> 00:00:56,998
要是他们给我一个理由
If they give me a reason,

17
00:00:57,623 --> 00:00:59,456
我就会将曼特城夷为平地
I'm gonna remove Mantle from the equation.

18
00:01:01,081 --> 00:01:03,706
这是我们拯救擎天的方式
This is how we save Atlas.

19
00:01:07,623 --> 00:01:09,456
你管这叫拯救擎天?
You call this saving Atlas?

20
00:01:09,498 --> 00:01:11,456
替塞伦完成她的事业?
Doing Salem's job for her?

21
00:01:12,790 --> 00:01:14,248
我曾相信你!
I believed in you!

22
00:01:15,581 --> 00:01:18,123
我以为我们可以一起找到更好的道路
I thought we could work towards something better.

23
00:01:19,123 --> 00:01:21,040
但你现在要把一切都丢弃
But now you're throwing it all away.

24
00:01:22,081 --> 00:01:24,790
如果你不乖乖闭嘴 我就来帮你把它闭上
If you don't shut your mouth, I'm going to do it for you.

25
00:01:25,165 --> 00:01:27,456
如果这样能让那些孩子听话
If this is what gets the children to cooperate,

26
00:01:27,665 --> 00:01:28,706
那么就是值得的
then it's worth it.

27
00:01:28,748 --> 00:01:32,581
我也不喜欢这做法 但我们的首要考虑是...
don't like this either, but the top priority is..

28
00:01:32,623 --> 00:01:34,915
你还相信你自己说的话吗?
Do you even believe what you're saying anymore?

29
00:01:35,373 --> 00:01:37,373
你们还相信任何事吗?
Do any of you believe in anything?

30
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,915
我曾为我的军衔而感到骄傲
I used to wear this rank with pride.

31
00:01:41,956 --> 00:01:43,748
现在我看清它究竟是什么了
Now I see it for what it really is:

32
00:01:44,706 --> 00:01:46,123
一副枷锁
a collar.

33
00:01:49,623 --> 00:01:50,206
啊!
Ah!

34
00:01:54,915 --> 00:01:57,998
你想要枷锁是吗?满足你
You want a collar? Fine.

35
00:01:59,123 --> 00:02:01,415
我去把这个叛徒扔进大牢
I'll throw this traitor in the brig

36
00:02:01,623 --> 00:02:02,873
那是他该去的地方
where he belongs.

37
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:22,790
好吧 埃隆伍德想要Penny
Okay, Ironwood wants Penny,

38
00:02:22,831 --> 00:02:24,790
不然曼特城就完蛋了
otherwise, Mantle is done for.

39
00:02:25,373 --> 00:02:27,081
那么 我们要怎么阻止他?
So, how do we stop him?

40
00:02:28,206 --> 00:02:30,581
克罗和罗宾还在他手里
Qrow and Robyn are still in his custody,

41
00:02:30,873 --> 00:02:34,415
而且梅说擎天的无人机还在监视巨坑
and May said that Atlas security drones are watching the crater,

42
00:02:34,956 --> 00:02:36,915
所以他们也被困住了
so they're trapped too.

43
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:40,248
塞伦也不会沉寂太久了
And Salem isn't going to stay gone for much longer.

44
00:02:40,498 --> 00:02:42,623
那就是说我们没办法了
So then, it's impossible.

45
00:02:43,248 --> 00:02:44,165
你看?
See?

46
00:02:44,831 --> 00:02:48,165
如果能解决一切的英雄小姐解决不了这个问题
If Miss Hero with all the answers doesn't have an answer,

47
00:02:48,581 --> 00:02:49,665
那么我们就用自己的办法
then we have ours.

48
00:02:49,915 --> 00:02:50,665
闭嘴
Shut up.

49
00:02:50,706 --> 00:02:52,165
那你为什么不快滚?
Okay, then why don't just leave?

50
00:02:52,456 --> 00:02:54,831
我们能不能都给对方一个机会?
Can we please just give each other a chance?

51
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:57,331
翡翠已经不是塞伦的人了
Emerald's not with Salem anymore,

52
00:02:57,915 --> 00:03:00,123
奥兹平也已经回来了
and Ozpin is back.

53
00:03:06,331 --> 00:03:08,623
所有的疑虑与不安还有不信任感
All of this doubt and worry and distrust,

54
00:03:08,665 --> 00:03:09,956
并不会帮我们解决任何问题
it isn't getting us anywhere.

55
00:03:09,998 --> 00:03:11,623
那任何事都没有改变!
Then nothing has changed!

56
00:03:12,915 --> 00:03:15,415
我们仍然跟昨天一样!
We're in the exact same place we were yesterday.

57
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:18,915
在王国等死的时候为该做什么而争吵
Arguing over what to do while the kingdom waits to die.

58
00:03:36,331 --> 00:03:37,123
我

59
00:03:38,790 --> 00:03:39,665
我很高兴你没事
glad you're alright.

60
00:03:44,081 --> 00:03:45,248
啊抱歉
Ah, sorry-

61
00:03:45,831 --> 00:03:47,456
无论我再怎么增强你
No matter how much I boost you,

62
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:48,706
它们还是不会消失
they won't go away.

63
00:03:49,623 --> 00:03:53,540
别道歉 我受伤是因为我做了一直在做的事
Don't apologize. I got hurt doing what I always do,

64
00:03:54,123 --> 00:03:56,831
只是Nora的又一次咎由自取
just another ditsy move from Nora.

65
00:03:58,290 --> 00:03:59,373
那 不是那样的
Th-that's not true.

66
00:04:01,290 --> 00:04:02,456
你又怎么会知道?
How would you know?

67
00:04:03,373 --> 00:04:05,498
我们本来应该是个团队
We were supposed to be a team,

68
00:04:05,540 --> 00:04:07,123
但那对你来说并不重要
but that didn't matter to you.

69
00:04:07,998 --> 00:04:10,415
事态不可控时 你就就把我们推开了
When things went wrong you pushed us away.

70
00:04:10,665 --> 00:04:14,081
你对所有人封闭了自己这样你就不用感受负面的感情了
You shove people out so you don't have to feel things that are hard.

71
00:04:22,748 --> 00:04:23,331
你说得对
You're right.

72
00:04:24,581 --> 00:04:25,706
我才应该道歉
I should be apologizing,

73
00:04:26,623 --> 00:04:27,331
跟你们俩道歉
to both of you.

74
00:04:29,581 --> 00:04:31,915
当当我们弄丢了奥斯卡 事态严峻起来的时候
W-when we lost Oscar and things got difficult,

75
00:04:33,831 --> 00:04:35,373
我说了很糟糕的话
I said terrible things.

76
00:04:36,498 --> 00:04:39,415
我当时很 很气我自己
I've been so.angry, at myself.

77
00:04:40,498 --> 00:04:42,123
气我没有黄金特工们强大
For not being as good as the Ace Ops,

78
00:04:43,123 --> 00:04:44,831
气在罗宾的集会上发生的事
for what happened at Robyn's rally,

79
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:46,748
气我自己弄丢了灯
for losing the lamp.

80
00:04:47,831 --> 00:04:51,123
我以为如果我集中精神更加努力些
I thought if I just focused on working harder,

81
00:04:51,498 --> 00:04:52,581
更强大一些
getting stronger,

82
00:04:53,206 --> 00:04:53,915
我们
that we,

83
00:04:55,206 --> 00:04:56,915
我 就不会失败了
I,wouldn't fail.

84
00:04:58,665 --> 00:04:58,956
但是
But,

85
00:05:00,415 --> 00:05:01,706
我最大的失败
my biggest failing

86
00:05:02,456 --> 00:05:05,706
就是我并没有当好队友 也没做好伴侣
was as a teammate and as a partner.

87
00:05:11,831 --> 00:05:14,040
啊 哈! 哈哈! 呃.
Ah ha! Ha ha! Uh....

88
00:05:14,081 --> 00:05:16,290
一切都过去了 兄弟!
All water under the bridge, buddy!

89
00:05:16,331 --> 00:05:20,290
啊 哈 我...得去看看克莱恩和Penny需要些什么
Ha ha! I'm uh... Gonna go see if Klein needs any help with Penny.

90
00:05:23,290 --> 00:05:27,956
Ren 我只是希望 意思是
Ren,I just wish,I mean,

91
00:05:28,956 --> 00:05:31,123
为什么你什么都不说呢
why didn't you say anything?

92
00:05:31,498 --> 00:05:35,915
我们作为团队有失败 但也有成功啊
So we failed as a team, but we succeed as a team too.

93
00:05:36,331 --> 00:05:37,540
是我拖累所有人
I was the one holding us back.

94
00:05:38,081 --> 00:05:41,081
不是Jaune 不是你 是我啊
Not Jaune, not you.Me.

95
00:05:42,456 --> 00:05:43,665
你错了
Well, you're wrong

96
00:05:44,081 --> 00:05:47,915
我所做也不过是讲烂笑话和拿锤乱砸罢了
All I do is make dumb jokes and smash things with a hammer.

97
00:05:47,956 --> 00:05:50,456
什么?才不是这样
What? That's not true.

98
00:05:51,623 --> 00:05:54,290
你全心全意地投入要做的事
You put everything you have into what you do.

99
00:05:54,331 --> 00:05:56,248
你支持着身边所有人
You support everyone around you,

100
00:05:56,748 --> 00:05:58,540
你不顾自己安危地帮助他人
you help without worrying about how it might hurt.

101
00:05:59,456 --> 00:06:00,331
这就是我所爱的
And that's what I love about...

102
00:06:02,415 --> 00:06:03,540
这就是为什么我...
Th-that's why I..

103
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,040
我爱你
I love you.

104
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:20,915
当我妈丟下我逃开戮兽
When my mom ran from the Grimm and left me behind,

105
00:06:22,331 --> 00:06:23,623
是你找到了我
you found me.

106
00:06:24,956 --> 00:06:26,706
我们成为了Ren和Nora
We became Ren and Nora.

107
00:06:28,748 --> 00:06:35,706
但在这次独立任务中 我不知道「纯粹的Nora」是什么样了
But I realized on this mission apart,I don't know who "Just Nora" is.

108
00:06:37,415 --> 00:06:42,665
而如果我想探寻到答案 我就必须一个人去探寻
And if I'm ever going to find out, then I have to do it alone.

109
00:06:45,373 --> 00:06:48,456
因为我一直都爱着你啊 Lie Ren
Because I've always loved you, Lie Ren,

110
00:06:49,706 --> 00:06:53,623
而且你那漂亮的脸蛋看起来已经好多了
and that pretty head on your shoulders seems like it's doing a lot better.

111
00:06:55,540 --> 00:07:00,581
但在成为你需要的伴侣前 我仍然需要先解决我的问题
But I still got to get mine's sorted out before I can be the partner you need.

112
00:07:01,706 --> 00:07:02,623
这样
Is that...

113
00:07:03,748 --> 00:07:04,748
可以吗
okay?

114
00:07:14,123 --> 00:07:15,873
当然可以啦
It's definitely okay.

115
00:07:19,915 --> 00:07:20,331
我点
Boop.

116
00:07:28,456 --> 00:07:30,206
你处理好走廊的监控了吗
You get those hallway cameras on a loop?

117
00:07:34,748 --> 00:07:37,081
他真的会这么做的
He's really gonna do it.

118
00:07:39,456 --> 00:07:41,998
除非我们先阻止他
Not if we stop him first.

119
00:08:00,581 --> 00:08:02,165
可能有更好的办法
There might be a better way.

120
00:08:02,331 --> 00:08:04,165
我告诉你 没有
I'm telling you there isn't.

121
00:08:04,415 --> 00:08:06,415
这事不只关乎你
Well, this isn't just about you.

122
00:08:07,123 --> 00:08:08,498
它关乎所有人
It's about everyone.

123
00:08:08,915 --> 00:08:13,040
我要直接打进学院 然后我要扫除虫豸
I'm going straight up to the academy and I am ending this.

124
00:08:13,081 --> 00:08:15,290
或者我们失败了 所有人都死了
Or we fail and people get killed.

125
00:08:15,331 --> 00:08:17,706
这是他的报应!
He deserves this!

126
00:08:26,123 --> 00:08:28,790
听着 我懂你
Listen, I get it.

127
00:08:29,581 --> 00:08:30,748
你很受伤
You are hurting.

128
00:08:31,540 --> 00:08:33,790
你已经受伤很久了
You've been hurting for a long time.

129
00:08:35,081 --> 00:08:39,706
但别假装得你现在的行为不是纯粹的私心
But let's stop pretending that what you're trying to do here is for anyone but yourself.

130
00:08:43,081 --> 00:08:45,165
克洛弗意味着很多
Clover was a lot of things.

131
00:08:45,581 --> 00:08:51,248
你尊重他 但在我看来 你是个更好的猎人
You respected him, but I gotta tell ya,I think you're the better Huntsman.

132
00:08:52,956 --> 00:08:55,248
不是因为你幸存了下来
Not because you're the one who walked away,

133
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:59,956
而是因为你才是那个为正义而战的人
but, because you're the one who was fighting for what was right.

134
00:09:03,373 --> 00:09:05,331
别告诉我你变了
Don't go telling me that's changed.

135
00:09:21,915 --> 00:09:25,998
那头大猎犬吊打我们如入无人之境
You know, that giant hound kicked us around like we were nothing.

136
00:09:27,415 --> 00:09:29,790
但Blake说你和雪倪家的人还是击败它了啊
But Blake said you and the Schnees managed to take it down.

137
00:09:31,998 --> 00:09:34,665
还是要和姐姐比强的哈
Still having to one-up your big sis, huh?/

138
00:09:36,290 --> 00:09:39,373
她告诉你那是啥了吗?内部的
Did she tell you what it was? Underneath?

139
00:09:41,623 --> 00:09:42,081
对
Yeah.

140
00:09:43,373 --> 00:09:45,331
你知道这意味着什么
You know what that means then.

141
00:09:47,248 --> 00:09:48,581
我不担心这件事
I wouldn't worry about that.

142
00:09:48,623 --> 00:09:49,998
这曾发生在咱妈身上
That's what happened to Mom.

143
00:09:58,915 --> 00:10:02,665
看到他的眼睛 我就知道了
When I saw its eyes, I knew.

144
00:10:03,915 --> 00:10:08,415
塞伦以前专杀像玛利亚那样有银瞳的人
Salem used to kill people with silver eyes, like Maria.

145
00:10:09,498 --> 00:10:11,665
但她一直想要我的活口
But she's)always wanted me alive.

146
00:10:12,998 --> 00:10:15,248
但为什么她变了呢 除非
But why would that change unless,

147
00:10:16,831 --> 00:10:21,706
她遇到妈妈时 学到了可以用银瞳干点别的事
when she met Mom,she learned she could do something new.

148
00:10:22,998 --> 00:10:23,873
Ruby
Ruby.

149
00:10:25,665 --> 00:10:27,373
我们不能骗自己
We shouldn't lie to ourselves.

150
00:10:27,706 --> 00:10:32,956
我浪费时间发射阿米特塔 以为这样援兵就会来 结果呢
I wasted our time getting Amity up, thinking help would come, but it didn't,

151
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,540
连阿米特都坠落了
and Amity fell.

152
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,748
我太幼稚了
I was being childish.

153
00:10:40,873 --> 00:10:42,790
你只是太乐观了
You were being optimistic.

154
00:10:44,206 --> 00:10:50,331
你想啊 盲目乐观不好 但纯粹悲观就意味我们彻底输了
Look, blind optimism isn't great but no optimism means we've already lost.

155
00:10:51,331 --> 00:10:52,915
我们要有希望
We need hope.

156
00:10:53,581 --> 00:10:55,915
我们要承担风险
We need to take risks.

157
00:10:55,956 --> 00:10:57,331
但在我这没管用啊
But mine didn't work.

158
00:11:00,415 --> 00:11:01,748
至少警告已经发出去了
It still got a warning out.

159
00:11:02,456 --> 00:11:05,165
Ruby 世上从来没有确定的结果
Ruby, they're not called sure things,

160
00:11:05,456 --> 00:11:10,373
只有确定的风险 或许你没注意到 我在曼特的计划也失败了
they're called risks, and in case you didn't notice, my plan for Mantle didn't work either.

161
00:11:11,331 --> 00:11:15,998
但我们救回了奥斯卡 还做了很多不在计划的事
But we got Oscar back, and did a lot more that was never in the plan.

162
00:11:20,623 --> 00:11:22,873
咱妈在她出动那天选择了承担风险
Mom took a risk the day she left,

163
00:11:23,498 --> 00:11:28,331
尽管我不认为 不认为事情有按她的预想发展
and I donif think! don't think it went the way she wanted it to,

164
00:11:30,998 --> 00:11:32,581
但她仍然是我的英雄
but she's still my hero.

165
00:11:42,123 --> 00:11:43,331
快来
Hurry!

166
00:11:48,331 --> 00:11:50,290
我不能再被拖延了
I can no longer be delayed.

167
00:11:52,415 --> 00:11:53,623
Penny 拜托了
Penny, please!

168
00:11:53,665 --> 00:11:54,123
我
I...

169
00:11:54,165 --> 00:11:56,248
我必须打开宝库
I must open the vault.

170
00:11:56,706 --> 00:11:59,081
我 我不想.
I, I do not want...

171
00:11:59,456 --> 00:12:00,040
啊
Ah!

172
00:12:00,665 --> 00:12:02,415
Ruby 阻止我!
Ruby, stop me!

173
00:12:02,456 --> 00:12:03,040
Penny!
Penny!

174
00:12:04,581 --> 00:12:08,040
我必须打开宝库 然后自毁
I must open the vault and self-terminate.

175
00:12:17,456 --> 00:12:18,331
我抓住她了!
I've got her!

176
00:12:18,915 --> 00:12:19,915
我们怎么做
What do we do?

177
00:12:25,540 --> 00:12:28,665
我必须打开宝库
I must open the vault,

178
00:12:29,665 --> 00:12:31,123
然后自毁
and self-terminate.

179
00:12:34,081 --> 00:12:35,081
做点什么啊
Do something!

180
00:12:38,915 --> 00:12:39,665
